AGENT RUNTIMES — NOT REDISTRIBUTED
----------------------------------
The agent CLIs are deliberately NOT included in this image. They are installed on first
run, by you, under their own licenses:

  @anthropic-ai/claude-code   Anthropic's own terms ("SEE LICENSE IN README.md")
  @openai/codex               Apache-2.0
  hermes-agent                no license declared by the publisher

Because Claude Code is distributed under Anthropic's terms and hermes-agent declares no
license, neither may be redistributed inside a public image. Installing them at first
start keeps that decision — and its terms — with the operator. Review each tool's license
before enabling its backend. Set HR_BACKENDS to control which are installed.
